    "The demo deck has 3 topics (Travel, Work, Food & Dining) with 12 words each — great for testing without any setup.": "Le paquet de démonstration contient 3 thèmes (Voyage, Travail, Restauration) de 12 mots chacun — idéal pour tester sans configuration.",
    "Load demo deck": "Charger le paquet de démonstration",
    "Signed in as E2E Learner · e2e@local.test": "Connecté en tant que E2E Learner · e2e@local.test",
    "No deck cached.": "Aucun paquet en cache.",
    "Answered: 0": "Répondu : 0",
